# Next.js & React

## Structure
- Auth routes: `src/app/welcome`, `login`, `register`, `otp`
- Shop routes: `src/app/(shop)/` — home, categories, products, cart, checkout, orders, account, addresses
- Features: `src/features/<domain>/components/`
- Shared chrome: `src/components/layout/`
- Catalog and status labels: `src/data/`
- Types: `src/types/`
- Prefer Server Components. Add `"use client"` only for state, events, or `localStorage`

## Styling
- Tailwind v4 tokens in `src/app/globals.css`: `cream`, `leaf`, `fresh`, `orange`, `muted`, `line`, `chip`, `danger`
- UI text and titles both use Estedad (`font-sans` and `font-display`)
- Use `next/image` for product photos in `public/products/`
- Imports use `@/`

## Data
- Products come from `src/data/products.ts` (`getProduct(id)`)
- Money and Persian digits: `src/lib/format.ts`
- Cart math and shipping: `src/lib/commerce.ts`
- Browser shop state: `useShop()` in `src/lib/local-shop.ts`

## Forms
- Use React Hook Form (`useForm`, `register`, `handleSubmit`) for login, register, OTP, and address forms
- Field errors come from `formState.errors`. Server errors use `setError('root', { message })`
- Do not keep a separate `useState` copy of form fields

## UI
- Shared controls live in `src/components/ui/` (`Button`, `ButtonLink`, `TextLink`, `QuantityStepper`, `ProductCard`, `EmptyState`)
- Actions use `Button`. Navigation that looks like a button uses `ButtonLink`
- In-app navigation uses `next/link`. Do not use `<a>` for routes inside the app

## Layout
- Root `layout.tsx` sets `lang`, `dir`, fonts, and default metadata
- Do not wrap the root layout in another phone frame; auth and shop add `PhoneFrame` themselves
